;; Half Ahead's charter: the human-owned governance for the factory that
;; builds Half Ahead. Read by Lupa (`bb --config ../lupa/bb.edn lupa check`).
;; Seeded 2026-10-21 by the foreman session; Ben owns it from here.
;; The values in PRODUCT.md are the norms; this file holds what Lupa can
;; enforce or check.
{:charter/id "halfahead"
 :charter/purpose
 "Build Half Ahead: a humane place where agentic engineers and their agents
  hold conversations that flourish better than in ordinary messaging,
  through the graphical and temporal nature of writing and reading."

 :charter/invariants
 ["Flair never alters content: a performed message ends showing exactly
   the text that was sent."
  "Motion and sound are reducible; with reduced motion and sound off, no
   content is lost."
  "An agent is always shown as an agent, and as whose agent it is."
  "Pure functional core; side effects only in namespaces whose job is I/O."
  "Every behavior change ships with tests; `bb test` runs offline."
  "Firestore security rules are code: every rule change ships with rule
   tests."
  "This repository is public: no secrets, no members' personal data, and
   no text copied from private repositories."
  "Nothing merges to main without a human; the factory merges only into
   integration branches."]

 ;; Ben set a $150 cap for the first overnight drive (2026-10-21). Lupa has
 ;; no total-spend key yet; the foreman tracks it (DECISIONS.md H7).
 :charter/budget {:usd-per-tick 30.0
                  :usd-per-order 12.0}

 ;; The darkness dial. Start fully lit: a human reviews everything.
 ;; Lower a rate only on recorded evidence (see DECISIONS.md H8).
 :charter/review {:seed "halfahead-2026-10-21"
                  :default-rate 1.0
                  :always #{:high}}

 :charter/max-wave 3

 :charter/protected-branches #{"main" "master"}

 :charter/escalate
 ["An order halts twice on the same cause."
  "A node's :budget-usd exceeds :usd-per-order, or the drive's spend
   would pass its cap."
  "The work graph has a missing dependency or a cycle."
  "A change would touch the charter, the domain schema, the security
   rules' trust model, or DESIGN.md."
  "Anything that would deploy, send a message to a person, or spend money
   outside the agent engine."]}
